__pycache__/
*.pyc
hustler_old*.py
md

# Runtime state, not source: custom-mode save slots, study logs, and the
# frame you walked away from. r54: hustler_resume.json is deliberately NOT
# tracked -- the shot log, the profiles and the league are RECORDS that grow
# and are committed as they grow, but a half-played frame is true only while
# you are away from the table and meaningless once you sit back down.
hustler_layout_*.json
hustler_resume.json
*.jsonl

# ...except the human shot log, which is tracked ON PURPOSE (r38). It is not
# scratch: it is the record of every shot played, it grows with every session,
# and it is committed as it grows. Expect it to show as modified after playing
# -- that is real data, not a phantom.
!hustler_shots.jsonl
